# New default scene — terrain pass, based on the broad geography of target.png.
# Rebuild: cargo run --no-default-features --example bake_elevation
# World X points east; world Y points north. Heights and distances are map units.
# The 1024-square PNG covers a 25.6 × 17.0667 rectangle without stretching the islands.
